====Knockout phase====
{{main|2023–24 UEFA Champions League knockout phase}}

=====Round of 16=====
As a result of finishing top of the group, Arsenal were seeded for the round of 16 draw which took place on 18 December 2023, and would play the second leg at home. They were drawn against [[Primeira Liga|Portuguese]] side [[FC Porto|Porto]], who finished second in [[2023–24 UEFA Champions League group stage#Group H|Group H]], level on points with [[FC Barcelona|Barcelona]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/news/0288-19b91c975152-b2d5c7146274-1000--champions-league-round-of-16-draw-napoli-vs-barcelona-inter-/ |title=Champions League round of 16 draw: Napoli vs Barcelona, Inter vs Atlético de Madrid, Lepzig<!--sic--> vs Real Madrid |date=18 Dec 2023 |website=UEFA |access-date=18 Dec 2023}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.arsenal.com/news/porto-drawn-champions-league-round-16 |title=Porto drawn in Champions League round of 16 |last=Rogers |first=Jonathon |date=18 Dec 2023 |website=Arsenal FC |access-date=18 Dec 2023}}</ref>

