=====Quarter-finals=====
The draw for the remaining knockout rounds of the competition was held on 15 March 2024. Arsenal were drawn to face the previous season's [[2022–23 Bundesliga|Bundesliga]] champions [[FC Bayern Munich|Bayern Munich]] in the quarter-finals, with the home leg first. Bayern Munich won [[2023–24 UEFA Champions League group stage#Group A|Group A]] and progressed past [[SS Lazio|Lazio]] 3–1 on aggregate in the [[2023–24 UEFA Champions League knockout phase#Lazio v Bayern Munich|round of 16]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/news/028b-1a6a23265d8b-103c8d8e89c6-1000--champions-league-quarter-final-draw/ |title=Champions League quarter-final draw: Real Madrid vs Man City, Paris vs Barcelona |date=15 Mar 2024 |website=UEFA |access-date=15 Mar 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.arsenal.com/news/bayern-munich-drawn-champions-league-last-eight |title=Bayern Munich drawn in Champions League last eight |last=Rogers |first=Jonathon |date=15 Mar 2024 |website=Arsenal FC |access-date=15 Mar 2024}}</ref>

